  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">实体信息（Entity Information）模组通过使用“信息之杖”来显示实体信息。它为模组开发者提供了一种简便的方式，以获取来自原版游戏及其他模组的实体信息。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/entity-information/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>输入命令 <strong>/informationstick</strong> 或 <strong>/ist</strong> 即可获得信息之杖。<br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/entity-information/b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\">用这根杖击中实体后，将发送各种有用的信息。它可用于调试或开发其他模组。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>变量说明：</strong><em>(Entity entity = e.getEntity());</em><br><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">名称 (1.12)</span></strong>: <em>entity.getName();</em><br><span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong>名称 (1.13+)</strong></span>: <em>entity.getName().getString();</em><br><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">实体名称</span></strong>: <em>entity.toString().split(\"\\\\[\")[0];</em><br><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">实体ID</span></strong>: <em>entity.getEntityId();</em><br><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">UUID</span></strong>: <em>entity.getUniqueID();</em><br><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">位置</span></strong>: <em>entity.getPosition().toString().replace(\"BlockPos{\", \"\").replace(\"}\", \"\");</em> <br><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">是否静默</span></strong>: <em>entity.isSilent();</em><br><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">存在刻数</span></strong>: <em>entity.ticksExisted;</em></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模组，前提是下载源必须保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在多个独立的模组页面上跟踪评论，因此已关闭评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他内容，请访问我们的 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
